      "bullets": [
        "Anthropic's Claude LLMs can analyze source code to identify subtle cryptographic vulnerabilities, such as weak randomness and improper padding.",
        "LLM-assisted security auditing complements traditional SAST tools by reasoning over complex mathematical logic and cryptographic implementation flaws.",
        "AI-driven vulnerability discovery accelerates patch management while lowering the barrier for auditing critical open-source cryptography codebases."
      ]
